{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this minimalist puzzle, your objective is simple: <strong>match three cubes of the same color to unlock the next color.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/extras/dropit_sm.gif?t=1743096560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t be fooled by the simplicity of the mechanics \u2014 <strong>as you progress, space starts to run out, and you\u2019ll need to be organized and clever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This short game has <strong>no time limit</strong>, allowing you to play at your own pace and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The total experience lasts around two hours,</strong> making it perfect for a quick session or a relaxing break in a busy day. <i>A Very Simple Puzzle</i> isn\u2019t meant to be a stressful challenge but rather a moment of relaxation and satisfaction, each time you reach a new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Its immediate accessibility makes it <strong>a game for everyone</strong>, appealing to both casual players and puzzle enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you manage to reach the final cube?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Simple concept</strong>: Match three cubes of the same color to unlock new elements and progress in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u231a <strong>Duration</strong>: A complete experience in about two hours, perfect for a short break or a moment of calm between activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Intuitive interface</strong>: A game that's easy to pick up, suitable for all types of players, whether they\u2019re beginners or puzzle fans. Compatible with both keyboard and controller.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Purple cube","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/46e824c0513d7b3ceb7138ef57e008fd3b50d13a.jpg"},{"name":"Pink cube","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/94e75c569a116778063c5f6c33a2f610ef39d09f.jpg"},{"name":"Red cube","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/844e3b2e9d211e91ae14677e00edf7e4c900642c.jpg"},{"name":"Black cube","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/af832b97aecb9136a41eccf68435d7eed62415c0.jpg"},{"name":"Rainbow cube","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/9b0a0ef00c49c48724c8f8ecff429327cd21b63c.jpg"},{"name":"WIN !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/4ff25f505874fa2962b1dd5aca51ceb1ff9fa11b.jpg"},{"name":"100th game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/ad5105e2b7f5484ff75a6de64d1440acf5c8f0d1.jpg"},{"name":"1 million","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/c9d72f7dfbdc441959def96f38e288930a8f91f1.jpg"},{"name":"10 million !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/680fc073fba41ee6592eab5ec4685f9af994c8ed.jpg"},{"name":"KO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3269680/121d00e2a467822aa5a778d70496587cfe382955.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3269680?t=1743096560","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743096560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/8cc0a3069c67cad299c189fc167c18084f1a8fde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743096560","capsule_ima