</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Simple concept</strong>: Match three cubes of the same color to unlock new elements and progress in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u231a <strong>Duration</strong>: A complete experience in about two hours, perfect for a short break or a moment of calm between activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Intuitive interface</strong>: A game that's easy to pick up, suitable for all types of players, whether they\u2019re beginners or puzzle fans. Compatible with both keyboard and controller.</p>","developers":["Magari"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269680/bfa2368085488edc658c184896a21aa60f1d4409/header.jpg?t=1743096560","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+ (Intel editor) Big Sur 11.0 (Apple silicon Editor)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel or M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> could be good...</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257062863,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257062863/movie480.mp4?t=1728818482","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257062863/movie_max.mp4?t=1728818482"},"name":"Trailer A Very Simple Puzzle","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257062863/562e724a4fadf3738e6f2fddf472853cf75d2ef1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1728818482","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257062863/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1728818482","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257062863/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1728818482"}}],"name":"A Very Simple Puzzle...","package_groups":[{"d